    "title": "County Little League team wins state championship; heads to regionals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cristina Caicedo Smit ,\n12 hours ago The county Little League 9 to 11 All-Star team will play in the regional tournament after battling back from an early loss to win the Maryland state championship. The team faces regional play in Beverly, Massachusetts this week. They will compete against state champions from across the Northeast from Delaware to Pennsylvania. Read full article\n5",
